  // ...
}
```

### Low: Formatting and Style
| Pattern | Issue | Severity |
|---------|-------|----------|
| Inconsistent semicolons | Aesthetic but fixable | LOW |
| Tab vs spaces mixing | Linter can enforce | LOW |
| Extra blank lines | Minor noise | LOW |
| Trailing whitespace | Cleaner diff | LOW |

